// # CRISPR & Cas Unified Genome Editing Facade
//
// Logline: Unified facade re-exporting SpCas9, Cas12a, Base Editing, Prime Editing, Off-Target scoring, and Epigenomic modules.
//
// Setup: Pure module shim and facade importing all 49 CRISPR/Cas companion submodules for openOODA genome engineering.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import 49 modular CRISPR Guide Design, Prime Editing, Base Editing, and Specificity subcomponents.
//   2. Re-export public constructors, scoring engines, off-target validators, and epigenetic integrators.
//   3. Maintain full backwards compatibility with downstream openOODA callers.

